{"data": [{"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:02:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114628642928271533", "2114635252639682571"], "id": "2114628642928271533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Below is a book on Zen practice, presented alongside its original Classical Chinese text, a modern Chinese version, and an English translation. Those who do not read Chinese can simply refer to the English version.\n(Chinese translation:", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2114628642928271533"}, {"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:28:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114628642928271533", "2114635252639682571"], "id": "2114635252639682571", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Below is a book on Zen practice, presented alongside its original Classical Chinese text, a modern Chinese version, and an English translation. Those who do not read Chinese can simply refer to the English version.\n(Chinese translation:", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2114635252639682571"}, {"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:40:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115046023089258511"], "id": "2115046023089258511", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论大G｜用缠论看 BTC，顺便聊聊美股、A股、港股和宏观\n\n每天固定更新：\n【大G早盘】06:00\n【大G午盘】14:00\n【大G夜盘】22:00\n30m/4H 中枢、买卖点、关键压力支撑，多空剧本和触发条件都写清楚\n\n【大G复盘】每次预测都打分，说对说错都公开\n【大G视频】每日解析视频，【大G一分钟】一分钟速看", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2115046023089258511"}, {"author_id": "1709583255001767936", "created_at": "2026-10-27T09:24:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115011695831630126", "2115025559637942436"], "id": "2115011695831630126", "public_me