chan/status/2114856870909476952"}, {"author_id": "1856738003450023936", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:35:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114501171499205029"], "id": "2114501171499205029", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "深度负GAMMA环境下 NAS 100盘前用CALLWALL29216+PIVOT R1+缠论顶背驰抓顶 一抓一个准", "url": "https://x.com/syanzi719/status/2114501171499205029"}, {"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:48:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114896866915889454"], "id": "2114896866915889454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#BTC 缠论速报 10/27\n现价80,242，30m贴中枢下沿收敛震荡，方向未选\n压力 80,639 / 81,200\n支撑 79,729 / 79,369\n4H三卖80,952仍压制\n多：站上80,639回踩不破，看81,200\n空：破79,729再破79,369，看78,575\n倾向中性偏多，结构见图\n不构成投资建议 #缠论 #比特币 https://t.co/zDV3eUwoU3", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2114896866915889454"}, {"author_id": "1709583255001767936", "created_at": "2026-10-27T10:19:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115011695831630126", "2115025559637942436"], "id": "2115025559637942436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114561246880256159", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "补一下实测：我自己很久以前也写过自用缠论指标，买卖点从结构底到确认，买卖点从结构底/顶到被确认，最少要晚 5 根 K 线，最多 23 根，中位数 9 根。\n\n延迟是缠论定义本身带来的，任何画线工具都绕不开。一个底要算数，得等后面成一笔向上：先要分型成立，顶和底之间还要隔一根独立 K https://t.co/x0thhtylTG https://t.co/MmiEMvbgyb", "url": "https://x.com/LaoLinTrading/status/2115025559637942436"}, {"author_id": "75539792", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:48:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927088604262533"], "id": "2114927088604262533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 119, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "当年的天