_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.26 https://t.co/JmtDtB9IHS 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114525316316344814"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:42:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114895471080767981"], "id": "2114895471080767981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月操盘手训练营今日10点开课，大家提前安排好时间参加直播课，本期训练营重点围绕缠论基础进阶教学进行，让基础比较薄弱的同学逐步形成稳定的缠论操作体系，训练一套适合自己的交易体系是一个艰难的过程，形成一套稳定盈利的交易体系更是如此，很多人会走回头路，但贵在坚持。", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114895471080767981"}, {"author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:36:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114862365971808596", "2114863796766593270"], "id": "2114863796766593270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 152, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "缠论心法3｜手痒是心态问题\n\n明明知道不是买点还忍不住下手，这是心态问题，不解决它任何理论都没用。\n\n你不是不懂，你只是手痒。\n\n你有没有过：图看懂了，规则熟了，可一看到某只票异动，还是点了买入？", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2114863796766593270"}, {"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:45:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114971776010592333"], "id": "2114971776010592333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【缠论大G·BTC视频】10/27 下午场：79640 小双底接住，30m 类二买下移到 79640，低点抬、高点压，收敛三角越收越窄；4H 三卖 80952 仍压着。上盯 80639（站上看 81034/81445），下盯 79640（跌破看 79221）。不构成投资建议 #BTC #比特币 #缠论 https://t.co/tC5U07Q9Xv", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2114971776010592333"}, {"author_id": "2109048614966403072", "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:36:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114954359947886895"], "id": "2114954359947886895", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "走玩 A 股的么？缠论+量化 https://t.co/siOsbjmXqr", "url": "https://x.com/Snipert48m/status/2114954359947886895"}, {"author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:30:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114862365971808596", "2114863796766593270"], "id": "2114862365971808596", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论心法3｜手痒是心态问题\n\n明明知道不是买点还忍不住下手，这是心态问题，不解决它任何理论都没用。\n\n你不是不懂，你只是手痒。\n\n你有没有过：图看懂了，规则熟了，可一看到某只票异动，还是点了买入？", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2114862365971808596"}, {"author_id": "1691362979424751616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:41:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114653651499442371"], "id": "2114653651499442371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "影响几代交易员的八大技术分析流派：\n价格行为：读懂当下走势\n道氏理论：先辨市场趋势\n威科夫：观察供需变化\n形态学：识别价格结构\n波浪理论：理解推动与调整\n缠论：拆解走势层级\n江恩理论：研究时间与价格\nICT：关注流动性与结构\n认识流派，也认识它们背后的时代。还有什么要补充的吗？", "url": "https://x.com/junhui1412/status/2114653651499442371"}, {"author_id": "2042445486741766144", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:08:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114736040825286757"], "id": "2114736040825286757", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "市场中没有上帝。\n\n无论任何规模的资金，归根结底都只是市场的分力，不是合力本身。\n\n只要是分力，就要观察市场当下的反应，根据市场反应的当下选择来选择。\n\n #缠论", "url": "https://x.com/xingluoL666/status/2114736040825286757"}, {"author_id": "3353223123", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:34:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114561246880256159"], "id": "2114561246880256159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 11401, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "顶背离继续消化中，空军YYDS\n看到不少小伙伴已经试用了，有什么问题建议欢迎评论区留言哈，7天免费试用，tradingview账号给我授权。\n缠论自动画线宝，告别画线老师~\n#trading https://t.co/X1dWBkUgW0", "url": "https://x.com/Paris13Jeanne/status/2114561246880256159"}, {"author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-26T05:16:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114586966473814320"], "id": "2114586966473814320", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 424, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "它爱涨多少涨多少，权当这只票不存在。\n\n缠论心法第1条：不追高。\n\n很多人亏钱，不是不懂技术，而是看着一只票飞起来，手比脑子快。追高买的不是股票，是别人的情绪。", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2114586966473814320"}, {"author_id": "1664895162961776640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:20:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114648456245776757"], "id": "2114648456245776757", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【缠论·隔日套利 10/26晚】\n今晚30min选股仅1只：星光股份(002076) B类——明日站上2.24回抽确认买，破2.16放弃，T+1~T+2收盘卖。\n上周五名单跟踪：达仁堂(A类)今+1.63%持有，止损40.45；锐科激光(A类)今-3.04%，守40.70。\n评分只用于排序，非上涨概率。超短线学习记录，仅供参考非投资建议", "url": "https://x.com/13397186868lxf/status/2114648456245776757"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2065684739865071616", "name": "MWGA", "username": "MWGA_GCF"}, {"id": "2114884465671712769", "name": "缠论大G", "username": "Chanlun_G"}, {"id": "1709583255001767936", "name": "老林｜交易日记", "username": "LaoLinTrading"}, {"id": "1592938896161001472", "name": "Crypto以缠解势", "username": "yycl_gaoshan"}, {"id": "1460885674333130756", "name": "醉墨", "username": "zuimolunchan"}, {"id": "1856738003450023936", "name": "Gex Dex Trader", "username": "syanzi719"}, {"id": "75539792", "name": "山野逐盈", "username": "baiocean"}, {"id": "925446092669489154", "name": "Peter Liu｜Wealth & Wellness", "username": "InGodWeBelieveU"}, {"id": "2109048614966403072", "name": "Sniper", "username": "Snipert48m"}, {"id": "1691362979424751616", "name": "Jane Jiang", "username": "junhui1412"}, {"id": "2042445486741766144", "name": "星落L", "username": "xingluoL666"}, {"id": "3353223123", "name": "K线教主